xrpld image - XRPL Node — honeycluster/nodekit
=======================================

Binary:       /opt/xrpl/bin/xrpld
Config:       /opt/xrpl/etc/xrpld.cfg
Validators:   /opt/xrpl/etc/validators.txt
Scripts:      /opt/xrpl/scripts/
Logs:         /var/log/xrpld/debug.log
Data:         /var/lib/xrpld/db/
Logrotate:    /etc/logrotate.d/xrpld

Useful commands
---------------
  xrpld server_info                                Show server status
  xrpld validation_create                          Generate a validator key pair
  xrpld --conf /opt/xrpl/etc/xrpld.cfg            Start xrpld manually
  cat /opt/xrpl/etc/xrpld.cfg                     View current config

Scripts
-------
  ./scripts/entrypoint.sh    Container entrypoint (runs on start)
  ./scripts/startup.sh       Daemon mode with logrotate
  ./scripts/shutdown.sh      Graceful shutdown
  ./scripts/logrotate.sh     Log rotation setup

Environment
-----------
  NETWORK          Network to connect to (mainnet, testnet, devnet)
  PATH             Includes /opt/xrpl/bin

Aliases
-------
  The binary is also symlinked as:
    /usr/bin/rippled
    /usr/local/bin/rippled

  Config is symlinked for default search paths:
    /etc/opt/xrpld/rippled.cfg -> /opt/xrpl/etc/xrpld.cfg
    /etc/opt/ripple/rippled.cfg -> /opt/xrpl/etc/xrpld.cfg

Documentation:  https://github.com/honeycluster/nodekit/blob/develop/docs/xrpld/
Config Ref:     https://github.com/honeycluster/nodekit/blob/develop/docs/xrpld/configuration.md
Source:         https://github.com/XRPLF/rippled
